 65NI  H TYP=FUL$AUT=Jun Chen$CIT=NDS 202, 59 (2025)$CUT=25-Feb-2025$           
 65NI c  2018Li59: E=84 MeV {+18}O beam was produced from the tandem accelerator
 65NI2c  at the Istituto Nazionale di Fisica Nucleare, Laboratori Nazionali del 
 65NI3c  Sud, Catania, Italy. Target was an enriched self-supporting {+64}Ni    
 65NI4c  foil with a thickness of 110 {I10} |mg/cm{+2}. Reaction produts were   
 65NI5c  momentum-analyzed with the MAGNEX magnetic spectrometer. Measured      
 65NI6c  particle energy spectra, |s(|q). Deduced levels. Comparisons with      
 65NI7c  shell-model calculations.                                              
 65NI cL E$Excitation energy is deduced from measured energy of {+17}O          
 65NI2cL (2018Li59)                                                             
