 65CU  H TYP=FUL$AUT=Jun Chen$CIT=NDS 202, 59 (2025)$CUT=25-Feb-2025$           
 65CU c  1976Sw01: E=1.5-4.7 MeV photons were produced by bremsstrahlung with   
 65CU2c  electron beam from the Bartol accelerator. Scattered |g rays were      
 65CU3c  detected with a Ge(Li) detector. Measured |g(|q). Deduced              
 65CU4c  levels, J, |p, widths, |g-ray branching ratios, multipolarities,       
 65CU5c  mixing ratios.                                                         
 65CU c  1975MoYT: photoexcitation of 7939 and 8484 resonances; measured E|g,   
 65CU2c  I|g, |g(|q), |g-linear polarization; deduced widths, Ge(Li)            
 65CU c  1967Gi15: resonant scattering. Measured |g(|q) with NaI. Deduced       
 65CU2c  widths for levels at 6070 and 8499                                     
 65CU c  1974Wo05: photoexcitation of 6556 resonance. Measured E|g, I|g, |g(|q) 
 65CU2c  with Ge(Li) and NaI detectors. Deduced branching ratios, widths.       
 65CU c  1964Be21,1968Me09: resonant scattering and self-absorption. Measured   
 65CU2c  |g(|q). Deduced widths, |g-ray mixing ratio                            
