 65ZN3dL 1973Vi13 value from 0.02 to 0.056 to reduce its relative weight from   
 65ZN4dL 89% to 50%. Then, the weighted average is 244.22 with a reduced-|h{+2} 
 65ZN5dL = 9.2 and an external uncertainty of 0.12.  The method of Normalized   
 65ZN6dL Residuals (1992Ja06) with all 17 values increases the uncertainties for
 65ZN7dL the four more discrepant values, namely to 242.8 {I6}, 258 {I5}, 244.52
 65ZN8dL {I21}, and 243.75 {I13} and then the weighted average is 244.06 d {I8}.
