 65ZN dL E$Least-squares fitting is done by GLSC (version 28-Aug-2024)          
 65ZN c  1994Ba55: E|a=30 MeV from the Variable Energy Cyclotron Centre,        
 65ZN2c  Calcutta. Targets were a natural Cu foil for lifetime measurement and  
 65ZN3c  >98% enriched {+63}Cu for other measurements. |g rays were detected    
 65ZN4c  with three large-volume HPGe detectors. Measured E|g, I|g, |g|g-coin,  
 65ZN5c  |g(|q), Doppler-shift attenuation. Deduced levels, J, |p, T{-1/2},     
 65ZN6c  |g-ray branching ratios, multipolarities, mixing ratios.               
 65ZN c  The level scheme in 1994Ba55 is based on their data and the            
 65ZN2c  (|a,n|g) data from earlier work.                                       
