 65ZN3c  natural Zn target. |g rays were detected with a Ge(Li) and a NaI(Tl)   
 65ZN4c  detector. Measured E|g, I|g , |g|g-coin. Deduced levels, J, |p, decay  
 65ZN5c  branching ratios, log {Ift}                                            
