 65ZN2cG relative to I{-rel}=100 for 864|g                                      
 65ZN cG $For pol values in comments, positive value indicates electric         
 65ZN2cG character and negative value for magnetic character                    
 65ZN cG E$Values with uncertainties are from 1974Ni01 up to 1969, from         
 65ZN2cG 1978Ne02 above 3336 level, and others in between are from average of   
 65ZN3cG values from both references, unless otherwise noted; values without    
 65ZN4cG uncertainties are from 1978Ko11, unless otherwise noted.               
 65ZN cG RI$Quoted values are branching ratios from 1978Ko11 up to 1588 level,  
 65ZN2cG from 1978Ne02 above that up to 4079 level for values with              
 65ZN3cG uncertainties, and those without uncertainties are deduced by the      
 65ZN4cG evaluator from relative intensities in 1974Ni01 as given under         
 65ZN5cG comments, unless otherwise noted.                                      
