 65GA dL E$Least-squares fitting is done by GLSC (version 28-Aug-2024)          
 65GA c  Adapted from the XUNDL dataset for 2001We11, compiled by G. Reed and   
 65GA2c  B. Singh (McMaster) July 23, 2001.                                     
 65GA c  2001We11: E=140 MeV {+32}S beam was produced from the Tandem XTU       
 65GA2c  accelerator at the Legnaro National Laboratory. Target was a 0.4       
 65GA3c  mg/cm{+2} {+40}Ca on a 3 mg/cm{+2} Au backing. |g rays were detected   
 65GA4c  with the 4|p spectrometer GASP consisting of 40 Compton-suppressed     
 65GA5c  large-volume Ge detectors and an 80 segment BGO multiplicity filter.   
 65GA6c  Measured E|g, I|g, |g|g-coin, |g(|q), |g|g(|q)(DCO). Deduced levels, J,
 65GA7c  |p, band structure, |g-ray multipolarities. Comparisons with Total     
 65GA8c  Routhian Surface calculations.                                         
 65GA c  1996MiZU: E=140 MeV {+32}S beam was produced from the JAERI tandem     
 65GA2c  accelerator. |g rays were detected with an array of 11 ACS-Ge detectors
 65GA3c  and charged particles were detected with a Silicon ball of 21 Si       
 65GA4c  detectors around target. Measured E|g, I|g, |g|g-coin,                 
 65GA5c  particle-|g-coin. Deduced levels, J, |p, band structures.              
 65GA c  The level scheme is that of 2001We11 and more complete than that of    
 65GA2c  1999Da10 in {+12}C({+58}Ni,|ap|g) and that of 1980Ka08 in              
 65GA3c  {+58}Ni({+12}C, |ap|g), and is adopted in the Adopted Levels, Gammas   
 65GA4c  by the evaluator                                                       
 65GA cG $R=Angular distribution asymmetry (ADO) for values given under         
 65GA2cG comments. Expected values are |?1.1 for a stretched quadrupole         
 65GA3cG transition and |?0.6 for a stretched dipole transition (2001We11).     
 65GA cG $For DCO values under comments, expected values are |?1.0 for a        
 65GA2cG stretched quadrupole transition and |?0.5 for a stretched dipole       
 65GA3cG transition, with gates on stretched quadrupole transitions.            
 65GA4cG For dipole transitions with |DJ=0 and small mixing ratios (|d<0.5), DCO
 65GA5cG is also |?1.0 (2001We11).                                              
 65GA cG E(F)$Poor fit; uncertainty multiplied by a factor in the fitting       
 65GA cG E(G)$Very poor fit and omitted in the fitting                          
 65GA cG E,RI$From 2001We11, unless otherwise noted                             
 65GA cG M$Deduced by the evaluator based on measured DCO ratios and/or angular 
 65GA2cG asymmetry ratios in 2001We11 as given under comments, unless otherwise 
 65GA3cG noted. Assignments are not explicitly listed in 2001We11.              
 65GA cL E$From a least-squares fit to |g-ray energies                          
 65GA cL J$From 2001We11 deduced based on measured |g(|q), |g|g(DCO), |g|g(ADO),
 65GA2cL band assignments and known assignments of low-lying states, unless     
 65GA3cL otherwise noted. When considered in the Adopted Levels, parentheses are
 65GA4cL used around the assignment if there are no strong supporting arguments.
