 65GA2c  accelerator. |g rays were detected with Ge(Li) and NaI(Tl) detectors.  
 65GA3c  Measured E|g and I|g. Deduced levels, Note that a band of levels       
 65GA4c  reported at |?5390 (1971Ne06) is probably due to a misprint and should 
 65GA5c  read 5930. Transitions from these states are reported to populate      
 65GA6c  levels at 0, 62, 191, 650, 815, and 1076 (1971Ne06).                   
