 65GE cL J$As proposed in 1997So06 for excited states, based on their measured  
 65GE2cL |g(|q) intensity ratios and comparisons with theoretical calculations. 
 65GE3cL The firm assignments here will be placed in parentheses when considered
 65GE4cL in Adopted Levels, if there are no other strong supporting arguments   
 65GE5cL for the firm assignments.                                              
