 65GE    40CA(28SI,2PNG)               1995HE27                  25NDS    202505
 65GE  H TYP=FUL$AUT=Jun Chen$CIT=NDS 202, 59 (2025)$CUT=25-Feb-2025$           
 65GE dL E$Least-squares fitting is done by GLSC (version 17-Jul-2024)          
 65GE c  Adapted from the XUNDL dataset of 1995He27, compiled by G. Reed and    
 65GE2c  B. Singh (McMaster) on July 9, 2001.                                   
 65GE c  Also includes {+40}Ca({+31}P,|apn|g) for |g(lin pol) data in 1995He27  
 65GE c  1995He27: E=93 MeV {+28}Si beam was produced from the tandem Van de    
 65GE2c  Graaff accelerator of the University of Cologne. Target was about 1    
 65GE3c  mg/cm{+2} 99.96% enriched {+40}Ca backed by a 89 mg/cm{+2} Bi-In-Cu    
 65GE4c  layer. |g rays were detected with the OSIRIS ring spectrometer         
 65GE5c  consisting of six Compton-suppressed Ge detectors in conjunction with a
 65GE6c  four segmented neutron detector. Measured E|g, I|g, |g|g-coin,         
 65GE7c  n|g|g-coin, |g(|q). Also measured |g(lin pol) using                    
 65GE8c  {+40}Ca({+31}P,|apn|g) at E=115 MeV with the Compton polarimeter POLALI
 65GE9c  comprised of five HPGe detectors. Deduced levels, J, |p, |g-ray        
 65GEac  multipolarties, mixing ratios. Systematics of neighboring Ge isotopes. 
 65GE c  1987Go02: E=60-100 MeV {+28}Si beams were produced from the University 
 65GE2c  of Pennsylvania's tandem Van de Graaff accelerator. Target was 350     
 65GE3c  |mg/cm{+2} {+40}Ca evaporated onto a 30 mg/cm{+2} gold backing. |g rays
 65GE4c  were detected with one pair of Ge detectors; charged particles were    
 65GE5c  detected with a 4|p multi-segment detector consisting of phoswich      
 65GE6c  scintillator telescopes; neutrons were detected with a neutron         
 65GE7c  detector. Measured E|g, I|g, charged particle-|g|g-coin, n|g(|q),      
 65GE8c  particle-|g(t). Deduced levels, J, |p, T{-1/2}, |g-ray multipolarities,
 65GE9c  mixing ratios. Comparisons with theoretical calculations.              
 65GE c  Other: 2013Ru13 (111|g, 864|g, 1254|g and 1356|g seen from {+65}Ge as  
 65GE2c  a contanimant)                                                         
 65GE d  Others: 1986ChZD, 1979MuZX, 1980MuZV                                   
